abstract: "Public reproducibility verifier and machine-readable output files for the manuscript Fibonacci Character Sums at Rank Index Two and Jacobsthal Sums. The verifier checks finite-range evidence for rank-index-two Fibonacci character-sum identities and their reductions to Jacobsthal sums, separating theorem-level checks from exploratory checks and density context."

